This client parses an OpenAI-compatible SSE stream. It works against most servers but silently drops content against one that emits multi-line data fields and sends a non-OpenAI keepalive event. Find every defect and produce a corrected version.

```python
def stream(resp):
    out = []
    for line in resp.iter_lines(decode_unicode=True):
        if not line.startswith('data: '):
            continue
        data = line[6:]
        if data == '[DONE]':
            break
        obj = json.loads(data)
        delta = obj['choices'][0]['delta']
        if 'content' in delta:
            out.append(delta['content'])
    return ''.join(out)
